Copyright (c) 2026 TLAY

This product is the companion reference integration for the SF Drone Show 2026
nanopayment demonstration, built by TLAY in collaboration with Circle, Arc, and Arkreen.

This product depends on the following open-source software at runtime, fetched
via the listed dependency manager and not vendored in this repository:

  - TLAY-IO/boat-mer (Apache-2.0)
    BoAT MER - Machine Economy Runtime
    https://github.com/TLAY-IO/boat-mer
    Fetched via ESP-IDF Component Manager (apps/*/idf_component.yml)

  - TLAY-IO/hashanchor (Apache-2.0)
    HashAnchor client SDK (@tlay/hashanchor-client)
    https://github.com/TLAY-IO/hashanchor
    Fetched via npm (cloud/settle-worker/package.json)

  - Eclipse Mosquitto (EPL-2.0 / EDL-1.0)
    https://mosquitto.org/
    Used as MQTT broker (cloud/docker-compose.yml)

  - Next.js (MIT)
    https://nextjs.org/
    Used for the demo visualization web UI (cloud/web/)

External services depended on (not redistributed):

  - HashAnchor sandbox endpoint
    https://hashanchor.xid.network (settle bridge, operated by TLAY)

  - Circle Gateway batched x402
    https://gateway-api.circle.com (operated by Circle)

  - Arc Testnet
    Public test network for settlement
